(Delivery time = waiting for the next contact \(multi-pass drain for large files, at the nominal rate\) + propagation \(range / c\) +) Tj
T* (serialisation \(payload bits in CCSDS AOS frames of 1,115 bytes, one frame minimum, at the nominal rate\) + terrestrial) Tj
T* (fibre \(great-circle distance x 1.5 route factor at 2/3 c plus 0.5 ms per hop for 12 hops\) + the ground processing time) Tj
T* (entered. GEO relay: LEO-GEO about 37,800 km, GEO-gateway from geometry, relay rate from the catalogue, fibre from) Tj
