(Link budget: free-space loss, ITU-R P.676 gaseous absorption \(zenith value / sin el\), ITU-R P.838 rain \(k, alpha at the) Tj
T* (band; 3 km rain height; P.618 reduction\), pointing 0.5 dB, polarisation 0.3 dB, implementation 1.5 dB, antenna efficiency) Tj
T* (0.6, roll-off 0.35, required Eb/N0 from CCSDS 130.1-G performance curves. Uncoded BER = 0.5 erfc\(sqrt\(Eb/N0\)\); coded) Tj
